From 29f86c3fc87e5af455767cd09e9822e0930487c2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 09:30:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] placement recovery: thread the board into
 hub_keep_reason; public pickup.card_fields; fail-closed test

Follow-up to PR #2038 review 5888732161 (non-blocking nits):
- hub_keep_reason no longer hardcodes board "default": available_mode -> recovery_mode -> promotion_mode ->
  hub_keep_reason pass the reevaluated board (keyword, default "default"; reevaluate still only runs on default).
- kanban_hub_admission_pickup._fields is now the public card_fields; every caller (claim screen, worker-first
  selfcheck, placement recovery, mandatory-pin test) uses the new name. No other users, so no alias.
- Tests: an unreadable row (missing column; card_fields raising KeyError/TypeError/ValueError) keeps the card
  on the hub with no recover(promote) call; the threaded board reaches card_fields (a non-default board keeps it).

Task: t_01a1d4387504745e
